{
  "description": "X6: aggregate counts and prints the verifier labels whose bound verdict came from the inbox (via inbox) and lists them in synth.json inbox_returns. V01's verdict came from the inbox, V02's from a transcript: only V01 is named; a verifier with no verdict is not an inbox label. (Item joins as in aggregate-missing-verdict.)",
  "now": "2026-10-12T12:00:00Z",
  "steps": [
    {
      "argv": [
